<% content_for :title, "Join a match" %>

<h1>Join a match</h1>

<p class="lede">
  Somebody sent you an invite link. Paste the whole address, or just the code at the end of
  it, and you take the free seat in their match.
</p>

<%= render "joins/form", invite: @invite %>

<p class="mode__note">
  Online play needs an account in both seats, so you are asked to sign in first if you are
  not already. A link only works once, and the player who created a match cannot join it.
</p>
